                    {
                        "translation_id": "410a3ffc-bbac-4481-902b-25802c24aa96",
                        "source_entry_id": "426ebd44-71a5-317b-9bbf-3cc56adeaae8",
                        "source_sense_id": "9aa31efc-4edc-369e-8084-c6d142938872",
                        "source_sense_description": "unklares, ungekonntes Schreiben",
                        "target_lang_word": "doodle",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "doodle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "619dd3e1-646f-379f-9502-714650e188b5",
                                        "entry_id": "a8608fe4-8768-3539-b796-15502ba820fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fool, a simpleton, a mindless person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f695b95e-d9dc-4ada-b905-7a821becad93",
                                                "sense_id": "619dd3e1-646f-379f-9502-714650e188b5",
                                                "text": "Mrs. Sneak. Why doodle! jackanapes! harkee, who am I?\nSneak. Come, don't go to call names: am I? vhy my vife, and I am your master."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "655e4bbc-ae98-4997-bb7d-33819fc9895c",
                                                "sense_id": "619dd3e1-646f-379f-9502-714650e188b5",
                                                "text": "Perceval. Weep on! weep on! thou flouted loon,\nWeep on! weep on! thou gowky doodle!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef72c9af-f7de-4a6c-823a-065eb51b9da9",
                                                "sense_id": "619dd3e1-646f-379f-9502-714650e188b5",
                                                "text": "Courtier, it was thine to bow —\n Great Arthur he, and Doodle thou!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "854f8fad-b681-3149-93a9-f477801936eb",
                                        "entry_id": "a8608fe4-8768-3539-b796-15502ba820fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small mindless sketch, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1b06569f-057a-3ab0-9c25-fb5cef0ee76d",
                                        "entry_id": "a8608fe4-8768-3539-b796-15502ba820fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The penis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "childish",
                                            "slang",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3485822-d38b-436c-9ee7-f0878f0e4a4b",
                                                "sense_id": "1b06569f-057a-3ab0-9c25-fb5cef0ee76d",
                                                "text": "His doodle hung as limp as last month's celery."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "034c0765-6962-4a7d-ada0-0d8951938a52",
                                                "sense_id": "1b06569f-057a-3ab0-9c25-fb5cef0ee76d",
                                                "text": "Her favorite had been when she'd convinced the lascivious guards that Dinah's red hair meant she was a witch, and if they molested her, their doodles would shrivel up between their legs and fall off. Daisy had assured her that no man would risk losing his doodle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5422f7b-a186-4dde-83fd-caf5287292bb",
                                                "sense_id": "1b06569f-057a-3ab0-9c25-fb5cef0ee76d",
                                                "text": "All of Dwight's parts wandered, especially his doodle. He had the wandering-est doodle in three states. His doodle had its own set of legs. His doodle was hardly at home. Heck, according to rumor Dwight Farris's doodle was hardly ever in his pants."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "doodle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "922a3c06-95d1-3bab-8095-b38955dad6f4",
                                        "entry_id": "e42309e6-903c-3fb5-bee5-ba1242b9230a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To draw or scribble aimlessly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32433a5d-8b99-4b8b-a3c3-c608f6bacdfc",
                                                "sense_id": "922a3c06-95d1-3bab-8095-b38955dad6f4",
                                                "text": "The bored student doodled a submarine in his notebook."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6c8455b-1eba-3e73-b96d-9ef80d706e8a",
                                        "entry_id": "e42309e6-903c-3fb5-bee5-ba1242b9230a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To engage in something non-seriously; fiddle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92d8c43d-6e82-4a99-9da4-98096226e22f",
                                                "sense_id": "a6c8455b-1eba-3e73-b96d-9ef80d706e8a",
                                                "text": "I've been expecting women's music finally to discover New Wave and technopop, and this album is the evidence that someone has been peaking ^([sic]) at music videos and doodling around with sythesizers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db0a585d-baf7-423a-83f4-35524caf3ca9",
                                                "sense_id": "a6c8455b-1eba-3e73-b96d-9ef80d706e8a",
                                                "text": "I can tell you that he does indeed spend a lot of time on business and social calls, social chats, doodling around on AOL, and skimming the daily paper while those patients are piling up."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b207042-10e2-4c51-b75b-055ec860ba82",
                                                "sense_id": "a6c8455b-1eba-3e73-b96d-9ef80d706e8a",
                                                "text": "For quite a long time now (at least the 1990s) people have been doodling with the idea of separating space and time again and perhaps endowing them with some properties currently not assigned to them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46d9c45b-0c84-37b4-a41a-e037a5edf3b6",
                                        "entry_id": "e42309e6-903c-3fb5-bee5-ba1242b9230a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To drone like a bagpipe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Scotland"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
